Note: Granular synthesis with composable jitter PRNG.
Note: Composer-facing: (granular buf grain=50ms density=20Hz jitter=0.3 windowing=#hann)
Note: Returns a Buffer of the SAME length as input (granular is texture, not stretch).
Note: Jitter PRNG routes through ctx.PrngRegistry — two-run cmp-clean preserved.
Note: Cost model: CPU cost ~ density * grain * sampleRate * output-duration.
internal proc granular(Buffer: buffer, Double: grain, Double: density, Double: jitter)
internal proc granular(Buffer: buffer, Millisecond: grain, Hertz: density, Double: jitter)
internal proc granular(Buffer: buffer, Millisecond: grain, Hertz: density, Double: jitter, Symbol: windowing)

Note: Time-stretch with vocoder/psola/auto mode dispatch.
Note: Composer-facing: (stretch buf 2.0 mode=#auto frameSize=4096 transientThreshold=0.25)
Note: factor=1.0 fast-paths to identity (byte-identical to input).
Note: #auto mode emits a one-shot stderr advisory per call-site summarizing the
Note: per-frame vocoder vs psola split.
Note: All knobs (frameSize/hopSize/overlap/transientThreshold/
Note: pitchPeriod/windowSize) reach the underlying DSP engine end-to-end.
Note: Universal named-arg surface — composer can pass any subset of knobs
Note: by name; the resolver picks the overload at the matching arity.
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod)
internal proc stretch(Buffer: buffer, Double: factor, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod, Int: windowSize)

Note: Pitch-shift via stretch+resample; cents=0 identity fast-path.
Note: Composer-facing: (pitchShift buf +5st mode=#auto) or (pitchShift buf +50c).
Note: Accepts Double cents, Cent literal (+50c), or Semitone literal (+2st — auto-scaled).
Note: Universal named-arg surface — same knob bag as stretch, all 6 knobs honored.
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Semitone: semitones, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Double: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod, Int: windowSize)
internal proc pitchShift(Buffer: buffer, Cent: cents, Symbol: mode, Int: frameSize, Int: hopSize, Int: overlap, Double: transientThreshold, Int: pitchPeriod, Int: windowSize)
