Note: ===== Beat <-> Second tempo-aware conversion =====
Note: Both read the active MusicalContext.Tempo at call time; default 120 BPM + one-shot stderr advisory when no tempo block is active.

Note: beatToSec(Beat) -> Second. 1 beat at 120 BPM = 0.5 seconds.
internal proc beatToSec(Beat: beats)

Note: secToBeat(Second) -> Beat. 1 second at 120 BPM = 2.0 beats. Symmetric inverse.
internal proc secToBeat(Second: seconds)
